    "player_hint_1_en": "(H)+(B) cannot be in the Park or they would block Elevator (B). (H)+(B) also cannot be in North Tower or they would block Elevator (A). They must be in South Tower, this isolates (B) in the only chair in South Tower.",
    "player_hint_2_en": "This sets the woman in Elevator (B) in row 12. This sets (H) and the unknown woman in C11-C12 in any order.",
    "player_hint_3_en": "Someone must be in North Tower R4, this area can't be empty. (D) can't be on a Sidewalk: a Sidewalk is occupied by (A)+(I), who are alone together, the other is occupied by (J), who's also alone. The only area where (D) could be is in North Tower or Elevator A, beside an empty Fountain.",
    "player_hint_4_en": "(K) is two rows south of someone beside a statue, and the person beside the statue must now be in the Park. This sets (K) in R12. This isolates someone beside the statue in R10 C4, which isolates (H), then (K).",
    "player_hint_5_en": "(A)+(I) now cannot both fit on the South Sidewalk, they must be on the North Sidewalk. (A) who's north of (I) must then be in R2 C10, (I) in R5, (J) in R8.",
    "player_hint_6_en": "With (K) being in Elevator B, (E) must be in Elevator A, in R1. This isolates (D) in the last square adjacent to the Fountain area.",
    "player_hint_7_en": "(C) is the only person who fits in R10 C4. This isolates someone in the car in R7 C1, block the rest of R7 and C1. This isolates (E).",
    "player_hint_8_en": "This isolates (I) on the last square on the North Sidewalk that's east of (D). There's only one square available for (F), in R7 C1, which isolates (G) in the last available C2 square.",
    "player_hint_9_en": "This isolates (J), and (V) in the last remaining square. (V) was alone with (F), Felicia is the murderer!"
 
